<title>USA: BankAmerica to reissue 125 cards.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica to reissue 125 cards.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said it will reissue about 125 of its ATM and debit cards to holders in Arizona after it learned that some may have been used fraudulently in Japan.</p>
<p>&quot;We think it may have affected 30 to 40 customers in Arizona, but as an added proportion, we re-issued about 125 cards,&quot; said BankAmerica Corp.</p>
<p>He said an investigation was underway but declined to provide further details.  He said the affected cards represented a tiny fraction of BankAmerica's 10 million ATM cards.</p>
</text>
